  "qualityRules": [
    "Keep sensor identity and placement with the data.",
    "Separate observed symptoms from diagnosis.",
    "Record irrigation inputs and root-zone response in the same event chain.",
    "Do not interpret pH or EC without sampling and instrument context.",
    "Use repeatable morphology definitions and scouting scales."
